WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.550
[theme music playing]

00:36.619 --> 00:39.706
20 YEARS AGO

00:40.331 --> 00:43.293
[women sobbing]

01:01.644 --> 01:03.938
[Seong] I have gone to be with Do-hwa.

01:04.022 --> 01:06.775
[Seong] When she bears a child,
knowing that it is mine.

01:08.651 --> 01:10.528
[baby Jang Uk crying]

01:14.199 --> 01:15.283
[crying continues]

01:15.366 --> 01:16.367
[maid Kim] My Lord.

01:16.868 --> 01:18.203
My Lord, where are you taking--

01:20.413 --> 01:23.124
[intense music playing]

01:29.005 --> 01:30.590
[Heo Yeom] We heard the news about Do-hwa.

01:30.673 --> 01:32.801
We're about to pay our respects, too.

01:32.884 --> 01:36.554
What are… What are you doing here
when you should be in mourning, huh?

01:37.514 --> 01:40.558
I am here because this is the only way
to change the fate of this child.

01:44.020 --> 01:46.731
[dramatic music playing]

01:47.899 --> 01:49.234
[metal sword swishing]

01:50.527 --> 01:52.237
[ground cracking]

01:55.156 --> 01:57.367
[water sloshing]

02:00.120 --> 02:01.121
What are you doing?

02:01.204 --> 02:02.956
[loud impact]

02:09.170 --> 02:10.964
[baby Jang Uk crying]

02:18.555 --> 02:19.681
[Jin shouts]

02:27.730 --> 02:29.149
Gang, what have you done to him?

02:29.232 --> 02:31.442
I have completely blocked
the child's gate of energy.

02:32.360 --> 02:34.571
He will live,
but he won't be able to learn any spells.

02:37.991 --> 02:38.908
From this point forward,

02:38.992 --> 02:41.161
no one must open
this child's gate of energy.

02:42.078 --> 02:45.498
How could a father
do something so horrible to his own son?

02:48.084 --> 02:49.043
My son?

02:58.678 --> 03:00.513
[young Jang Uk] Why does he get
to decide my future?

03:01.806 --> 03:04.017
No one even considers him
to be my father, anyway.

03:04.809 --> 03:05.977
[young Jang Uk] I will find someone.

03:06.769 --> 03:10.523
A master who is willing to
open up my gate of energy and teach me.

03:11.733 --> 03:13.318
I will find someone on my own.

03:14.819 --> 03:17.030
And unsheathe that sword
so I can break it in half.

03:22.201 --> 03:24.704
[Jang Uk] Over the years
I have found 12 teachers,

03:24.787 --> 03:26.623
and have been expelled every time.

03:27.582 --> 03:31.252
At last, I finally found the master
who will change my fate.

03:31.336 --> 03:33.963
[dramatic music playing]

03:43.056 --> 03:44.724
I knew you'd be my master…

03:46.643 --> 03:47.852
as soon as I saw them.

03:58.905 --> 04:02.283
So I guess, um, you've noticed
something special about me, Young Master?

04:02.367 --> 04:03.493
That's how it seems.

04:04.619 --> 04:06.287
[suspenseful music playing]

04:06.871 --> 04:08.248
I told you you had beautiful eyes.

04:08.331 --> 04:10.667
Oh, right. Only your eyes.

04:12.335 --> 04:14.837
The blue mark of a Soul Shifter
bloomed like them in a flower.

04:16.589 --> 04:18.591
[Mu-deok] So the mark
was in my eyes the whole time.

04:21.302 --> 04:22.220
[laughs in disbelief]

04:22.971 --> 04:24.180
Are you really going to fight me here?

04:24.264 --> 04:25.974
I can kill you and no one will know.

04:26.557 --> 04:27.725
But we're in Songrim, though.

04:28.601 --> 04:29.602
They'll catch you.

04:35.692 --> 04:38.236
[intense percussive music playing]

04:42.699 --> 04:44.200
[Jang Uk] I intend to save your life.

04:44.701 --> 04:47.745
If I am by your side,
they might not catch you.

04:47.829 --> 04:50.498
[footsteps approaching]

04:50.581 --> 04:52.667
[suspenseful music playing]

05:01.718 --> 05:03.928
If you don't want to get caught,
you should call me…

05:06.431 --> 05:08.599
- "Young Master."
- [metal swishes]

05:08.683 --> 05:11.436
[tense music playing]

05:21.070 --> 05:21.904
Jang Uk?

05:22.655 --> 05:23.656
Oh, you.

05:24.282 --> 05:26.075
What are you doing in Songrim?

05:26.159 --> 05:28.453
[suspenseful music playing]

05:29.746 --> 05:31.205
Who's that woman?

05:32.165 --> 05:33.374
Oh.

05:34.125 --> 05:36.002
[Jang Uk] This is Mu-deok,
the servant who's been taking care of me.

05:38.629 --> 05:39.839
Mu-deok?

05:42.508 --> 05:45.053
Yul, I believe
you gave Mu-deok quite a scare.

05:45.136 --> 05:46.763
Would you mind
putting that pointy thing away?

05:47.847 --> 05:48.765
[sighs]

05:50.016 --> 05:51.684
- [sighs in relief]
- [sword clanks]

05:51.768 --> 05:53.644
Mu-deok, are you okay?

05:53.728 --> 05:55.813
[whimsical music playing]

05:56.731 --> 05:58.024
Mu-deok, hey.

06:00.068 --> 06:01.819
I am fine now, Young Master.

06:02.403 --> 06:03.321
Hmm.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.281
[Dang-gu] Jang Uk?

06:06.157 --> 06:07.158
[Jang Uk] Oh.

06:08.493 --> 06:10.995
[hesitates]
What-- what are you doing here?

06:11.079 --> 06:12.538
I came here to see our leader.

06:12.622 --> 06:14.624
But I got surprised by the fighting
so I came in here.

06:15.833 --> 06:18.127
We had intruders in Songrim
and you can't even handle a fight.

06:18.211 --> 06:21.089
[Dang-gu] You, if they saw you,
you would have been in big trouble.

06:21.172 --> 06:22.632
- No.
- [Dang-gu] No, no, no, wait.

06:22.715 --> 06:25.051
You did the right thing, actually.
You ran and hid, yeah.

06:25.134 --> 06:27.845
I didn't run. My servant ran away,
so I ran after her.

06:27.929 --> 06:30.348
You--
[groans]

06:30.431 --> 06:32.141
So who's this girl?

06:35.228 --> 06:37.522
[tense music playing]

06:37.605 --> 06:38.523
What's with the knife?

06:45.238 --> 06:46.656
This girl…

06:49.283 --> 06:51.285
Wait, did you protect him with that knife?

06:52.161 --> 06:53.955
Wow, how admirable.

06:54.038 --> 06:57.333
You see, your Young Master is very weak,

06:57.416 --> 06:59.335
so you must protect him, yeah.

06:59.418 --> 07:01.504
[whimsical music playing]

07:01.587 --> 07:02.672
[Mu-deok] Yes.

07:02.755 --> 07:04.966
I must protect him, my Young Master.

07:06.175 --> 07:08.302
No, wait, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.889
I should be the one
protecting you, Mu-deok, hmm?

07:13.975 --> 07:15.143
What's with the strong grip?

07:15.893 --> 07:16.978
You won't let go?

07:18.312 --> 07:19.313
[Jang Uk grunts]

07:25.027 --> 07:28.573
Huh? What's with that look?
You shouldn't look at me like that, huh?

07:29.323 --> 07:30.491
Mu-deok, you should look down, right?

07:33.161 --> 07:35.371
Yes, Young Master.

07:35.455 --> 07:36.581
Mm.

07:37.165 --> 07:38.916
[Seo Yul] So you were the one
who ran away from me.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.126
Mu-deok, was it?

07:41.461 --> 07:42.795
My apologies for startling you.

07:44.380 --> 07:47.383
[somber music playing]

07:55.266 --> 07:56.434
Do you have any injuries?

08:09.572 --> 08:10.573
Hey, Mu-deok.

08:11.532 --> 08:13.951
No, I'm all right, Young Master.

08:16.954 --> 08:19.040
- Is everything all right outside?
- [Dang-gu] No.

08:19.123 --> 08:20.291
It's still chaos out there.

08:20.875 --> 08:22.835
That Soul Shifter, Naksu,
her body's missing.

08:24.170 --> 08:26.547
[Mu-deok] Just as I thought,
those men were sent by the Danju.

08:27.340 --> 08:28.549
I need to get out of here.

08:30.718 --> 08:31.761
[Jang Uk] Oh, what a pity.

08:32.720 --> 08:33.971
A Soul Shifter.

08:34.055 --> 08:36.015
The Shadow Assassin Naksu.

08:37.350 --> 08:39.310
I was very curious to see
what she looked like

08:39.393 --> 08:40.895
before she switched to another body.

08:40.978 --> 08:43.105
[tense music playing]

08:43.189 --> 08:44.607
[Mu-deok] He knows who really I am.

08:45.399 --> 08:47.902
Before I leave, I have to kill him.

08:52.448 --> 08:54.283
[Sang-ho] They must have broken
the pine forest barrier

08:54.367 --> 08:55.368
and escaped through here.

08:59.121 --> 09:01.249
[epic music playing]

09:02.625 --> 09:04.001
[electric explosion]

09:08.756 --> 09:10.716
I see. They broke the barrier.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.885
- We'll follow them.
- [Jin] It's too late for that.

09:14.428 --> 09:16.931
[Jin] Only the people of Songrim
are able to break the barrier.

09:18.224 --> 09:19.809
We have a spy among us.

09:21.602 --> 09:23.729
We must ask the Jin family for their help.

09:30.486 --> 09:33.114
[Dang-gu] They kept Naksu's body here,
in this secret room.

09:34.574 --> 09:36.784
[Dang-gu] Hey Uk, did you notice
anything suspicious

09:36.867 --> 09:37.994
while hiding in Jeongjingak?

09:38.077 --> 09:39.078
Suspicious?

09:39.787 --> 09:41.372
Mm, no. I only saw Mu-deok.

09:42.540 --> 09:45.710
[suspenseful music playing]

09:47.003 --> 09:50.715
What if Naksu shifted her soul
into another woman's body

09:50.798 --> 09:52.550
and retrieved her original one?

09:56.012 --> 09:58.264
So a woman can only shift her soul
into another woman?

09:58.347 --> 09:59.473
[Seo Yul] It's not the only way.

09:59.557 --> 10:00.933
But to avoid the souls clashing,

10:01.017 --> 10:03.394
you should shift into a body
that's similar to yours.

10:03.477 --> 10:06.022
Gender, age, and build
should be as close as possible.

10:08.107 --> 10:09.525
I only ask because I haven't seen her,

10:09.609 --> 10:13.654
but did Naksu really have short limbs,
this thin,

10:13.738 --> 10:16.407
and this round, like Mu-deok here?

10:16.490 --> 10:18.326
[Mu-deok] What the hell is his problem?

10:21.412 --> 10:23.372
If she really looked like her,
would people have given her

10:23.456 --> 10:26.125
a scary nickname like "Naksu"?
I mean, look at her.

10:26.208 --> 10:29.003
[Dang-gu] What kind of assassin
would look this cute?

10:29.086 --> 10:30.838
[laughs awkwardly]
You're right.

10:30.921 --> 10:33.174
That Naksu must have looked like
a monster.

10:33.257 --> 10:35.426
Stop that. She was a human being.

10:37.303 --> 10:40.348
Let's not speak ill of the dead,
even if she was an assassin.

10:44.560 --> 10:46.103
[footsteps approaching]

10:46.187 --> 10:48.314
[male mage] Forgive me,
Master Heo Yeom wants to see you.

10:48.397 --> 10:50.358
You two go.
I don't like that old man, anyway.

10:50.441 --> 10:52.151
Okay. It'll be safer for you to stay here.

10:52.234 --> 10:53.402
[Dang-gu] Let's go.

11:01.077 --> 11:03.162
[suspenseful music playing]

11:03.245 --> 11:04.955
[Jang Uk knocks]

11:05.039 --> 11:06.624
This is where her body was frozen.

11:06.707 --> 11:08.542
Seeing how there's no rotting smell,

11:08.626 --> 11:10.503
it seems like
your body is still in one piece.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.673
Naksu.

11:15.132 --> 11:16.133
You're right.

11:17.134 --> 11:19.470
I am the one known as the Shadow Assassin.

11:22.348 --> 11:23.474
Naksu.

11:23.557 --> 11:26.394
[sinister stinger plays]

11:28.270 --> 11:30.481
I've been thinking about
why you keep helping me.

11:32.733 --> 11:34.485
Did the Danju also send you?

11:34.568 --> 11:36.987
You're wrong. Nobody sent me here.

11:37.071 --> 11:38.989
Then why have you been helping me out?

11:39.073 --> 11:42.451
I've already told you why,
but I guess you still don't understand.

11:45.204 --> 11:46.539
Your beautiful eyes…

11:47.289 --> 11:48.541
No way.

11:49.834 --> 11:51.085
Are you really in love with me?

11:51.168 --> 11:53.295
- [quirky music playing]
- [scoffs]

11:53.379 --> 11:54.505
Stop laughing.

11:55.089 --> 11:57.174
It's the only reasonable thing
I can think of.

11:57.258 --> 11:59.176
I'll admit
that I've been calling you beautiful.

12:00.344 --> 12:02.012
But only because I want something
from you.

12:02.805 --> 12:03.806
And what is it you want?

12:04.640 --> 12:07.184
I've been searching all over
to find the greatest master to serve,

12:07.268 --> 12:08.769
the one who'll open my gate of energy.

12:09.728 --> 12:11.021
And then, I ran into you.

12:13.315 --> 12:14.358
Naksu.

12:15.401 --> 12:16.986
I want you to be my master.

12:17.069 --> 12:19.530
[harmonious music playing]

12:26.954 --> 12:29.582
[suspenseful music playing]

12:32.793 --> 12:33.919
[Heo Yeom] I just received word.

12:34.003 --> 12:36.046
Did you really call
the Jin family's ghost, Sapsali?

12:36.630 --> 12:37.590
Yes.

12:37.673 --> 12:41.135
So do you believe
there's an intruder here in Songrim?

12:41.218 --> 12:42.344
I'm beyond certain.

12:43.429 --> 12:47.057
I'm sure at this moment,
there's a Soul Shifter among us.

12:50.394 --> 12:52.646
[Mu-deok scoffs]
The son of the legendary Jang Gang

12:52.730 --> 12:55.399
of Songrim is asking
Naksu the Shadow Assassin

12:55.483 --> 12:56.484
to be his master?

12:57.818 --> 12:59.487
I would never have imagined such nonsense.

13:01.572 --> 13:03.782
The master will open
the pupil's gate of energy

13:03.866 --> 13:05.618
and help him master spells.

13:05.701 --> 13:08.621
In return, the pupil will hide the master
so that she can stay safe.

13:08.704 --> 13:11.457
We could form a great team together and
we can get what we want from each other.

13:11.540 --> 13:13.501
- No way.
- Well, if you don't want to be my master,

13:13.584 --> 13:15.503
we can say I fell for you
and I could become your husband.

13:15.586 --> 13:17.254
- Is that better?
- Shut up.

13:17.338 --> 13:20.216
I heard you've had plenty of masters
and each one has kicked you out.

13:20.299 --> 13:22.927
Did they kick you out
because you were always this ridiculous?

13:26.388 --> 13:28.474
My former masters
didn't have any weaknesses

13:28.557 --> 13:29.642
so I couldn't threaten them.

13:30.184 --> 13:33.896
But I'll serve a new master.
And she has pretty big weaknesses.

13:37.107 --> 13:39.109
You won't get out of here alive
without me.

13:40.361 --> 13:42.112
You're dead if they know
you're a Soul Shifter.

13:43.113 --> 13:44.156
Is that so?

13:44.949 --> 13:46.116
Well, if that's the case…

13:47.034 --> 13:49.495
[ominous music playing]

13:50.037 --> 13:51.622
…I'll have to kill you right here.

13:53.666 --> 13:56.585
So ruthless,
if you kill someone who's helped you.

13:56.669 --> 13:59.713
My apologies, but I am more cold-blooded
than I am cute.

13:59.797 --> 14:02.716
[intense music playing]

14:08.847 --> 14:11.100
I gave you the Jade Plaque
and brought you to my home,

14:11.809 --> 14:13.852
and I let you come to Songrim
with the Spirit Plaque.

14:14.645 --> 14:16.730
And here we are, alone in this room.

14:21.068 --> 14:22.611
[loud rumbling]

14:24.530 --> 14:26.115
[Jang Uk] This is Songrim's secret room.

14:27.157 --> 14:28.951
Once that door closes,
we can only get out

14:29.034 --> 14:30.536
if somebody opens it from the outside.

14:32.288 --> 14:33.372
We'll be locked in here together.

14:35.624 --> 14:36.792
Stop, don't move!

14:37.293 --> 14:39.795
If you step on the wrong spot now,
and the ground will cave in.

14:43.507 --> 14:45.634
Kill me, and you'll be killed, too,
by the Songrim mages

14:45.718 --> 14:47.303
who'll enter through that door.

14:47.386 --> 14:50.764
So, if you agree to be my master,
we'll both get out of this room alive.

14:54.268 --> 14:57.062
[Mu-deok] I don't have the strength
to open his gate of energy right now.

14:57.771 --> 14:59.648
If we're stuck in here, we'll be caught.

15:00.316 --> 15:01.275
I will need my sword.

15:02.651 --> 15:04.194
Shifting souls has made me weak.

15:04.695 --> 15:07.239
I need my sword's energy
to open your gate of energy.

15:08.073 --> 15:09.199
So, without my sword,

15:09.950 --> 15:12.536
I won't be able to open it,
no matter how long we're trapped in here.

15:13.662 --> 15:15.122
To get my sword, we need to go.

15:16.582 --> 15:17.708
Now.

15:17.791 --> 15:18.834
So stop.

15:21.170 --> 15:22.463
I told you to stop it.

15:22.546 --> 15:23.672
I can't stop it right now.

15:23.756 --> 15:25.591
You can't raise it again
until it's all the way down.

15:26.300 --> 15:27.301
[exhales in anger]

15:27.384 --> 15:29.470
You! That was all a lie, was--

15:29.553 --> 15:31.764
- [rumbling]
- [both yelping]

15:32.598 --> 15:33.849
You need to stop moving.

15:33.933 --> 15:36.185
I told you the ground would cave in
if you step anywhere.

15:36.769 --> 15:38.354
- [Mu-deok screams]
- [Jang Uk grunts]

15:39.146 --> 15:40.773
Hey, hold on tight! You're slipping!

15:41.815 --> 15:44.360
- Hey, why's your face down there? Hey!
- Shut up!

15:44.443 --> 15:46.070
- [Jang Uk] Hey!
- Hey, hey!

15:46.153 --> 15:47.196
Why are you--

15:47.863 --> 15:50.532
- That really hurt!
- It wasn't intentional, I promise you.

15:50.616 --> 15:52.743
- It really hurts!
- Just hold on. You need to stay still.

15:53.327 --> 15:54.203
[Mu-deok] Stop!

16:00.000 --> 16:03.045
Um, by the way,
how will we find your sword?

16:03.128 --> 16:05.130
I know the person who took it.
I can find it.

16:06.173 --> 16:08.342
[Jang Uk] Going outside
of Songrim is too dangerous.

16:08.425 --> 16:10.135
We need to deal with this
while we're still here.

16:11.428 --> 16:13.263
[Jang Uk]
Does it have to be that sword, huh?

16:13.347 --> 16:15.140
Can you use another sword
imbued with energy?

16:15.224 --> 16:17.351
I can't. It can only be my sword.

16:18.060 --> 16:20.104
For now, let's get out of here
and find it.

16:21.063 --> 16:23.774
[Mu-deok] First, I'll lure him
out of Songrim, and then, I'll kill him.

16:25.693 --> 16:27.277
Is your energy really that weak?

16:30.280 --> 16:32.533
I thought you were acting clumsy
on purpose to hide it.

16:34.076 --> 16:35.077
So it's really gone weaker?

16:38.330 --> 16:40.457
The mages are coming this way. Be alert.

16:43.669 --> 16:46.547
But why do I need to be alert?
Those people are on my side.

16:47.131 --> 16:47.965
[scoffs]

16:48.048 --> 16:50.551
This isn't the time to talk about sides.
Such a child.

16:50.634 --> 16:52.469
Don't speak casually to your Young Master.
Be alert.

16:52.553 --> 16:54.930
Oh yes, Young Master.
I'll lower my gaze.

16:55.806 --> 16:56.974
Uh.

17:04.398 --> 17:05.274
Who is this person?

17:06.066 --> 17:09.069
I am Mu-deok, the new servant
taking care of Young Master Jang Uk.

17:11.697 --> 17:14.199
Hmm. You've heard, right?
She's my servant. I brought her here.

17:14.283 --> 17:15.909
You all seem busy,
so please carry on, then.

17:15.993 --> 17:18.412
- Let's go, Mu-deok.
- [Sang-ho] You cannot leave.

17:21.081 --> 17:22.624
The leader ordered everyone in Songrim

17:22.708 --> 17:24.084
to gather at the Training Center
immediately.

17:26.587 --> 17:27.838
But I'm not a member of Songrim.

17:27.921 --> 17:29.965
He wants every single living thing
within these walls

17:30.799 --> 17:33.052
to gather there,
including you and your servant.

17:33.135 --> 17:34.762
[tense music playing]

17:37.556 --> 17:39.892
[crowd chattering indistinctly]

17:41.643 --> 17:43.020
- [Dang-gu] Uk.
- Ah.

17:45.564 --> 17:47.316
[Jang Uk] What's going on?
Why are we all gathered in here?

17:48.025 --> 17:50.652
One of Naksu's men is in here.
They're going to catch him.

17:52.821 --> 17:54.073
Naksu?

17:55.032 --> 17:57.326
[suspenseful music playing]

18:04.833 --> 18:06.043
Among you

18:06.126 --> 18:09.004
stands a person who aided Naksu's men
in their attack on Songrim.

18:10.005 --> 18:10.839
My Lord,

18:10.923 --> 18:14.093
there is no one gathered here today
whose identity should be in question.

18:14.176 --> 18:17.805
On the outside,
you all look like members of Songrim.

18:20.182 --> 18:21.975
Which is why I've requested help.

18:23.435 --> 18:25.270
Lady Jin Cho-yeon
of the Jin family has arrived.

18:25.354 --> 18:26.438
She has Gwigu in her possession.

18:33.195 --> 18:36.490
[harmonious choral music playing]

19:02.099 --> 19:03.142
Greetings, my lady.

19:17.281 --> 19:19.241
Jang Uk? What is he doing here?

19:20.826 --> 19:22.035
I don't know.

19:23.120 --> 19:24.163
[sighs]

19:31.336 --> 19:34.965
Wow, no way. Must be Gwigu,
the Jin family's heirloom.

19:35.048 --> 19:36.049
Gwigu?

19:36.675 --> 19:37.968
- A dog?
- [Seo Yul] Hmm.

19:38.051 --> 19:40.762
A ghost that detects sorcery, Gwigu.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.393
[Jin] In this room,

19:47.644 --> 19:48.812
there is a Soul Shifter.

19:50.272 --> 19:54.359
And Gwigu will seek out that Soul Shifter.

19:55.027 --> 19:57.654
Gwigu will find the one
who looks like a Songrim member

19:57.738 --> 20:01.116
on the outside, but has a different soul
lying within them.

20:01.200 --> 20:03.994
[suspenseful music playing]

20:07.289 --> 20:09.041
You may now close the doors
to the Training Center.

20:09.124 --> 20:10.000
[mages] Yes, my lord!

20:14.880 --> 20:19.134
[Jin] As of now, anyone who attempts
to leave the Training Center

20:19.218 --> 20:23.180
will be considered a spy,
and will be executed.

20:24.431 --> 20:25.390
You may begin.

20:30.270 --> 20:32.773
[epic percussive music playing]

21:07.599 --> 21:09.768
- [loud rumble]
- [crowd exclaim]

21:16.233 --> 21:17.609
- [Gwigu crackling]
- [all exclaim]

21:21.071 --> 21:22.239
[roars]

21:26.827 --> 21:29.830
The sorcery of the Alchemy of Souls
has one weakness, you see.

21:29.913 --> 21:31.873
There's a gap
between the host body and the soul.

21:31.957 --> 21:33.500
[Dang-gu]
And the evil energy of the sorcery

21:33.583 --> 21:36.837
seeps out through that gap,
and Gwigu can detect that energy.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.755
[suspenseful music playing]

21:39.923 --> 21:41.133
[roars]

21:50.517 --> 21:52.102
[crowd screaming]

21:53.186 --> 21:54.396
[growls]

21:59.568 --> 22:02.321
[crowd exclaiming]

22:05.574 --> 22:08.577
Jang Uk, pretend you know nothing
even if they catch me.

22:10.996 --> 22:13.123
- What is this?
- My duty.

22:13.665 --> 22:14.791
[Gwigu growls]

22:14.875 --> 22:16.126
[crowd exclaiming]

22:19.296 --> 22:21.757
I do not want
to become the laughingstock of Songrim,

22:22.424 --> 22:24.384
simply because I got help
from someone like you.

22:24.468 --> 22:25.969
Stay right by my side.

22:27.137 --> 22:30.807
Not a single soul in Songrim
would ever allow that thing to attack me.

22:36.229 --> 22:37.272
[growls]

22:38.482 --> 22:39.983
[Gwigu roars]

22:47.908 --> 22:50.577
[crowd exclaim, scream]

22:51.453 --> 22:53.538
[action music playing]

22:55.707 --> 22:56.917
- [sword swishes]
- [crowd exclaim]

23:01.922 --> 23:03.298
A Soul Shifter! After him!

23:03.381 --> 23:07.469
- [mages exclaiming]
- [trampling footsteps]

23:10.806 --> 23:12.140
[sword swishes]

23:17.437 --> 23:19.272
[hurried footsteps]

23:24.236 --> 23:26.279
[suspenseful music playing]

23:28.782 --> 23:30.033
[swords clink]

23:30.117 --> 23:31.952
- [male mage shouts]
- [swords clanging]

23:32.035 --> 23:33.537
[men grunting]

23:57.853 --> 23:58.979
[shouts]

23:59.062 --> 24:00.772
[swords swishing, clanging]

24:03.817 --> 24:05.360
[soul shifter grunts, thuds]

24:13.118 --> 24:14.494
[soul shifter grunts]

24:15.120 --> 24:16.746
[blood splashing]

24:23.628 --> 24:25.088
[blood gurgling]

24:26.047 --> 24:27.507
[heaving]

24:31.928 --> 24:34.306
I'd heard Soul Shifters become petrified
when they run wild.

24:35.098 --> 24:36.558
[Dang-gu] I can't believe it's true.

24:36.641 --> 24:37.684
[sighs]

24:39.936 --> 24:41.980
[melancholy music playing]

24:59.539 --> 25:01.166
[loud rumbling]

25:04.878 --> 25:08.048
[Jin] Songrim has received great aid
from the Jin family today.

25:08.715 --> 25:10.967
I am sure one day
we'll ask for your help, too.

25:12.135 --> 25:13.345
[Heo Yeom] Come to think of it,

25:13.428 --> 25:15.639
the children
of Daeho's four great families

25:15.722 --> 25:16.723
are all gathered here.

25:16.806 --> 25:19.559
I've heard that you're called
the Four Seasons.

25:19.643 --> 25:23.313
Seeing you all here tonight
is truly a sight to behold. [laughs]

25:23.396 --> 25:25.106
Well, we used to get together quite often.

25:25.190 --> 25:28.401
But this is the first time since Uk
and Cho-yeon dissolved their engagement.

25:28.485 --> 25:29.819
[Dang-gu laughs]

25:29.903 --> 25:31.571
- [clicks tongue angrily]
- [laughs awkwardly]

25:32.447 --> 25:34.324
I've had them prepare tea
in the reception room.

25:34.407 --> 25:35.533
[Seo Yul] Please come this way.

25:42.290 --> 25:44.709
[Cho-yeon] So you were here, too,
Young Master Jang Uk.

25:44.793 --> 25:46.878
Is it true
that you were kicked out of Gisan?

25:47.462 --> 25:48.505
Oh, yeah.

25:49.381 --> 25:51.383
Are you still keeping track
of everything that I'm doing?

25:51.466 --> 25:52.884
You should just ignore it.

25:53.385 --> 25:54.344
[clears throat]

25:55.220 --> 25:58.056
The rumors of how you got
kicked out again were everywhere.

25:58.139 --> 26:00.934
- So I just happened to hear about it.
- Oh, okay.

26:02.560 --> 26:04.854
Our honored guest
seems uncomfortable around me,

26:04.938 --> 26:06.314
so allow me to excuse myself.

26:06.398 --> 26:08.775
[whimsical music playing]

26:09.943 --> 26:11.027
[whispers] Asshole.

26:13.405 --> 26:14.656
Should we…

26:16.324 --> 26:17.242
Come.

26:20.745 --> 26:21.871
[sighs]

26:29.254 --> 26:31.673
Hey, uh, so, uh…

26:32.757 --> 26:34.718
Have you seen my servant?
The one here just now?

26:35.302 --> 26:37.929
She's uh, she's short, thin,
she has a really round face.

26:38.013 --> 26:39.306
Oh, come on, seriously.

26:40.181 --> 26:41.391
Ugh, where did she go?

26:43.643 --> 26:46.521
[Mu-deok] So the spy the Danju planted
in Songrim was a Soul Shifter.

26:47.814 --> 26:49.983
I need to find the Danju.

26:50.066 --> 26:52.319
[playful music playing]

27:01.536 --> 27:03.538
I remember that you said
you were doing your duty.

27:04.122 --> 27:06.041
Is running away from your master
part of your duty?

27:07.208 --> 27:09.544
It's because of my duty
that I am leaving you.

27:09.627 --> 27:12.047
If things went accordingly,
I would have killed you already.

27:12.130 --> 27:13.089
[Jang Uk] Ah.

27:13.882 --> 27:15.258
So vicious.

27:15.342 --> 27:17.469
My apologies, but I'm not
the round-faced Mu-deok,

27:17.552 --> 27:19.012
who does everything you tell her to.

27:20.013 --> 27:22.891
You're Naksu. You cut off people's heads.

27:25.560 --> 27:28.313
I knew when I ordered you to prepare
my baths, I was risking my life,

27:28.396 --> 27:30.607
and I was risking it again
when I followed you to Songrim.

27:31.858 --> 27:33.985
So what am I to do when you're
the only one who can decide

27:34.069 --> 27:35.820
if you'll kill me and become my enemy,

27:35.904 --> 27:37.113
or open my gate of energy?

27:37.197 --> 27:40.075
[tense percussive music playing]

27:42.452 --> 27:43.912
And, just so you know,

27:43.995 --> 27:46.623
you have this habit where you stare
quite intensely at other people.

27:47.207 --> 27:48.375
They'll recognize you.

27:50.085 --> 27:52.253
Do you see the mark in my eyes
from where you're standing right now?

27:53.922 --> 27:55.298
No, I don't.

27:57.801 --> 27:59.177
Try again.

28:01.513 --> 28:02.847
I see it 'cause I've seen it before.

28:04.849 --> 28:05.975
What about now?

28:13.483 --> 28:15.110
I can definitely see it now.

28:15.193 --> 28:18.446
But I suppose it won't be often
that you get this close to anyone else.

28:18.530 --> 28:20.407
Just make sure to be careful
when you kiss someone.

28:22.742 --> 28:24.619
What's wrong? I'm only saying it
to be helpful.

28:24.702 --> 28:27.163
Those who've come that close to me
have all died by my hand.

28:29.916 --> 28:31.042
You could be the one who dies.

28:32.419 --> 28:33.628
The Sapsali.

28:33.711 --> 28:36.089
[eerie music playing]

28:38.133 --> 28:39.676
[growls]

28:41.219 --> 28:42.595
If the Sapsali attacks you,

28:42.679 --> 28:44.472
will you turn to stone
like the other Soul Shifter?

28:46.391 --> 28:47.517
Go.

28:49.811 --> 28:50.729
I'll try to save you.

28:50.812 --> 28:53.773
[action music playing]

29:08.913 --> 29:10.123
[Gwigu growls]

29:19.549 --> 29:21.009
[yelps]

29:21.760 --> 29:22.844
[grunts]

29:24.888 --> 29:26.306
[growls]

29:26.389 --> 29:28.933
[epic music playing]

29:48.953 --> 29:50.914
[breathing heavily]

29:50.997 --> 29:52.957
[soft music playing]

30:05.970 --> 30:07.639
[sighs in relief]

30:11.184 --> 30:12.977
[Cho-yeon gasps]

30:13.561 --> 30:15.188
Gwigu's pottery shattered.

30:15.772 --> 30:17.398
[Cho-yeon] It was our family heirloom.

30:18.691 --> 30:21.611
What, uh, happened was,
I was trying to take a look at it.

30:21.694 --> 30:24.781
But why would they make an heirloom
to be so fragile?

30:24.864 --> 30:26.199
[shouts] Jang Uk!

30:26.825 --> 30:27.784
[clicks tongue]

30:28.827 --> 30:29.828
Hmm?

30:29.911 --> 30:31.663
We need to have a talk. Come here.

30:32.330 --> 30:33.164
[Jin] Uk.

30:33.248 --> 30:35.375
[playful music playing]

30:35.458 --> 30:36.292
Uk.

30:38.586 --> 30:41.631
Hey, Jang Uk. Jang-- Jang Uk!

30:42.257 --> 30:43.091
[sighs]

30:46.594 --> 30:47.428
Uk!

30:49.097 --> 30:49.931
Uk!

30:50.723 --> 30:51.641
Jang Uk!

30:52.725 --> 30:53.935
Damn it!
[yelps]

30:55.103 --> 30:56.062
Uk!

30:57.272 --> 30:58.314
I must put it back together.

30:58.898 --> 31:00.608
So be sure to gather
every single piece of pottery.

31:00.692 --> 31:02.235
[maids] Yes, my lady.

31:06.865 --> 31:07.782
[sighs]

31:17.375 --> 31:18.585
[Dang-gu] Oh no, did he…

31:19.127 --> 31:20.962
That is the work of your Young Master.

31:22.672 --> 31:25.341
[Mu-deok] So he broke their heirloom
to save my life.

31:25.425 --> 31:26.509
[Dang-gu] Oh, Jang Uk.

31:26.593 --> 31:29.137
Just last year, he ended his engagement
with the Jin family's daughter.

31:29.220 --> 31:31.389
And now, look,
he shattered the family heirloom.

31:31.472 --> 31:33.975
- Engagement?
- Yeah. To her.

31:35.184 --> 31:37.061
He dissolved his engagement
to Lady Cho-yeon.

31:37.729 --> 31:41.274
[Dang-gu] No master, no engagement,
now there's no heirloom.

31:41.357 --> 31:42.650
Oh, boy, boy, boy.

31:45.737 --> 31:47.280
What will your Young Master do now?

31:48.197 --> 31:49.365
Where did the Young Master go?

31:50.366 --> 31:51.284
He got dragged off.

31:51.951 --> 31:55.288
Uk, I'm afraid they're gonna
punish you severely for this one.

32:02.712 --> 32:05.214
[Jin] I sent you all the way to Gisan.

32:06.466 --> 32:08.509
Then you were kicked out
in less than half a year.

32:09.510 --> 32:11.095
Why did you come to Songrim tonight?

32:11.679 --> 32:13.765
I heard you were devastated by the news
of me being kicked out.

32:13.848 --> 32:16.184
- So I came to personally apolo--
- [Jin] And this is how you apologize?

32:18.811 --> 32:21.689
Why, then, did you break that thing?

32:21.773 --> 32:24.734
Well, I mean, I was fascinated by it
and wanted to take a closer look,

32:24.817 --> 32:26.736
but I happened to drop it
because I had a weak grip.

32:26.819 --> 32:28.488
If someone had taught me
how to cast spells,

32:28.571 --> 32:29.530
it wouldn't have happened,

32:29.614 --> 32:30.907
so it happened
because I can't cast spells.

32:31.491 --> 32:32.408
[shouts]
Jang Uk!

32:34.243 --> 32:35.662
He also tampered

32:36.162 --> 32:38.247
with the door of the secret room
and damaged it, my Lord.

32:38.790 --> 32:41.000
[Heo Yeom] Why, that little--
He did that on purpose.

32:41.084 --> 32:42.710
He's just bitter.
[grunts]

32:42.794 --> 32:46.631
[Jin] This time, I will not allow you
to get away with what you've done.

32:46.714 --> 32:49.550
Until I say so, Jang Uk,
you're hereby forbidden

32:49.634 --> 32:51.636
from moving a single inch
from your position.

32:52.136 --> 32:53.930
And you're forbidden
from saying a single word.

32:55.056 --> 32:56.349
Reflect on it.

33:01.229 --> 33:02.188
[sighs]

33:04.857 --> 33:07.735
[somber music playing]

33:15.952 --> 33:17.286
You don't have to worry.

33:18.037 --> 33:19.914
He won't be punishing your master
for too long.

33:21.457 --> 33:23.793
This one time,
Uk was forced to sit out all night

33:23.876 --> 33:25.503
as punishment
and he almost died of a cold.

33:26.337 --> 33:29.298
[Dang-gu] His gate of energy was left open
just enough to keep him alive.

33:29.382 --> 33:32.051
So extreme cold or heat
could easily kill him.

33:32.844 --> 33:34.053
He won't recover if he gets sick.

33:34.637 --> 33:36.347
Then you should open his gate of energy.

33:37.056 --> 33:38.516
He's desperate for someone to help him.

33:38.599 --> 33:40.268
Why won't either of you open it?

33:41.894 --> 33:43.896
We do not have the ability to do that.

33:45.148 --> 33:46.399
But no one in Songrim--

33:47.150 --> 33:50.278
I mean, no one in Daeho
is able to open it for him.

33:55.491 --> 33:57.285
Then the Young Master
has already been dealt

33:57.368 --> 33:58.619
a lifelong punishment.

33:58.703 --> 34:01.372
[melancholy music playing]

34:03.291 --> 34:04.375
[sighs]

34:33.571 --> 34:35.364
I received permission
to bring you hot tea.

34:38.910 --> 34:39.786
Young Master.

34:40.661 --> 34:43.581
Your servant Mu-deok
will be departing now.

34:45.333 --> 34:46.542
What, you're gonna leave alone?

34:48.669 --> 34:49.670
[stick strikes]

34:54.008 --> 34:56.385
You're a master
who understands loyalty and duty.

34:57.261 --> 34:59.639
That is why you took me in.
That is why you brought me here.

35:00.723 --> 35:02.892
And that is why you've done everything
to protect me.

35:04.143 --> 35:05.186
I'm sure you know very well

35:05.269 --> 35:07.271
that you cannot say anything about it
to anyone.

35:09.690 --> 35:10.608
[sighs]

35:15.029 --> 35:18.282
[somber music playing]

35:20.243 --> 35:22.662
I will be safe because of everything
you've done for me.

35:33.840 --> 35:36.551
Throughout my life, I've only met those
who have wanted me dead.

35:38.052 --> 35:39.846
You're the first person who's ever tried…

35:41.389 --> 35:42.431
to save my life.

35:49.355 --> 35:51.399
Even if you come this close to me again,

35:52.441 --> 35:53.985
I promise I will spare you.

36:26.225 --> 36:27.059
Huh.

36:32.315 --> 36:33.191
[Jang Uk sighs]

36:45.661 --> 36:46.537
[sighs]

36:51.250 --> 36:53.544
[maid Kim] I shall send an apology gift
to Gisan,

36:54.045 --> 36:56.672
and repay the Jin family a hefty sum
for the heirloom

36:56.756 --> 36:58.216
that the Young Master broke.

36:58.799 --> 37:02.220
It was just--
Uk made too many mistakes this time.

37:03.930 --> 37:05.473
I had no choice but to punish him for it.

37:05.556 --> 37:07.391
You were right to punish him for that.

37:08.476 --> 37:09.852
Since you have done enough,

37:09.936 --> 37:11.771
may I please
take the Young Master home now?

37:12.855 --> 37:13.689
You may do so.

37:15.399 --> 37:16.525
Thank you very much.

37:22.531 --> 37:25.368
- [maid Kim] Are you all right?
- [Jang Uk] No, I'm not.

37:25.451 --> 37:27.453
[whimsical music playing]

37:27.536 --> 37:30.331
Mu-deok didn't return to the house,
did she?

37:30.414 --> 37:32.333
Why would she decide
to go back to the house?

37:33.292 --> 37:34.835
Speaking of which,
where did Mu-deok go

37:34.919 --> 37:36.879
when her Young Master
was being punished for his actions?

37:37.588 --> 37:38.589
Uh, forget it.

37:42.051 --> 37:44.762
So then, why did you tamper
with the secret room?

37:45.930 --> 37:47.348
The stone door won't close.

37:48.099 --> 37:49.225
I don't know.

37:51.102 --> 37:51.978
[maid Kim] Huh?

37:52.478 --> 37:54.397
- And why did you break the pottery?
- I said I don't…

37:56.816 --> 37:58.401
I said I don't know.
[hesitates]

37:59.026 --> 38:00.361
Please stop asking, okay?

38:02.238 --> 38:03.322
Hmm…

38:10.621 --> 38:12.623
Here are the fireworks you requested.

38:12.707 --> 38:14.500
You'll be able to see them
from miles away.

38:17.545 --> 38:18.462
Thank you.

38:19.839 --> 38:22.633
But why would Young Master Uk
want you to get him fireworks?

38:22.717 --> 38:25.344
A little birdie told me
he was punished severely.

38:25.428 --> 38:26.679
What is Young Master up to?

38:27.763 --> 38:29.682
[shushes]
It's a secret.

38:30.641 --> 38:32.351
Do not tell anybody about this, okay?

38:34.145 --> 38:35.396
Okay, Ju-wol?

38:37.273 --> 38:39.317
He should lay low
if he knows what's best for him.

38:40.109 --> 38:41.068
[Ju-wol sighs]

38:46.073 --> 38:48.034
A Songrim's Spirit Plaque?
[gasps]

38:48.117 --> 38:49.660
Are you allowed to enter Songrim?

38:50.161 --> 38:52.163
Your Young Master must really trust you.

38:52.246 --> 38:54.874
[gasps]
This is such a precious item.

38:56.250 --> 38:57.626
I'm looking to sell it, you know.

38:58.627 --> 39:01.213
But it won't be easy to find a buyer.

39:01.297 --> 39:02.298
Really?

39:02.798 --> 39:05.634
But a little birdie told me
that you know where to sell it.

39:05.718 --> 39:06.761
Ah, well yes,

39:06.844 --> 39:10.222
there is an inn I know of
that specializes in black market goods.

39:10.306 --> 39:11.599
[Ju-wol clears throat]

39:11.682 --> 39:14.560
But it will be very difficult to set up.

39:20.733 --> 39:22.860
Ah, you'll get a hefty sum.

39:22.943 --> 39:24.862
[Mu-deok] So then,
can you get me another chicken?

39:24.945 --> 39:27.698
[Ju-wol] Of course, I'll put it
on your Young Master's tab.

39:27.782 --> 39:29.700
Eat up. Have whatever you want.

39:29.784 --> 39:31.243
[suspenseful stinger plays]

39:32.703 --> 39:35.122
[eerie music playing]

39:36.874 --> 39:39.293
[Jin Mu] Although Naksu's corpse
may be here with us,

39:39.377 --> 39:41.087
her soul lives on in another body.

39:41.962 --> 39:43.589
You will also be born anew.

39:44.507 --> 39:47.051
Your new form shall be made
through the Alchemy of Souls.

39:47.968 --> 39:50.346
Don't be afraid to sacrifice yourselves.

40:04.652 --> 40:07.988
[intense percussive music playing]

40:11.742 --> 40:12.660
Fire!

40:13.494 --> 40:14.328
[bows squeaking]

40:14.412 --> 40:15.830
[arrows whooshing]

40:15.913 --> 40:17.623
[mages screaming in pain]

40:31.345 --> 40:32.430
[Mu-deok] I will need my sword.

40:33.431 --> 40:34.974
Shifting souls has made me weak.

40:35.683 --> 40:38.602
I need my sword's energy
to open your gate of energy.

40:38.686 --> 40:40.896
Even if you come this close to me again,

40:41.897 --> 40:43.399
I promise I will spare you.

40:45.359 --> 40:46.777
[pensive music playing]

40:48.112 --> 40:50.656
- Uh, ruining my appetite, seriously.
- [maid Kim] Young Master.

40:50.739 --> 40:51.824
[maid Kim panting]

40:53.033 --> 40:54.660
Young Master, they finally caught them.

40:54.743 --> 40:57.913
- Who? Mu-deok?
- Why would anyone be looking for her?

40:58.914 --> 41:01.041
Oh, well, never mind. Continue.

41:01.125 --> 41:02.835
Jin Mu, the Assistant Gwanju
of Cheonbugwan,

41:02.918 --> 41:05.212
caught the men who raided Songrim
and stole Naksu's body.

41:05.963 --> 41:06.881
Really?

41:06.964 --> 41:08.507
[tense music playing]

41:09.550 --> 41:12.470
Jin Mu took the bodies
of Naksu's men and marched into the palace

41:12.553 --> 41:13.429
for everyone to see.

41:13.512 --> 41:15.639
[Heo Yeom] But we were the ones
who caught Naksu.

41:15.723 --> 41:18.517
I worry that Songrim
will become a laughingstock.

41:18.601 --> 41:21.395
When Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan
apprehended the men,

41:22.146 --> 41:23.814
did he leave anyone alive for questioning?

41:23.898 --> 41:24.982
He had them all killed.

41:26.901 --> 41:29.945
Then we've lost the chance
to learn about the Alchemy of Souls.

41:31.197 --> 41:34.116
Oh, the leader of Jinyowon,
Jin Ho-gyeong, is here as well.

41:34.200 --> 41:35.534
[laughs]

41:38.746 --> 41:41.457
[Sun] So Jin Mu,
the Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,

41:41.540 --> 41:45.085
apprehended the culprit
when Songrim could not?

41:45.169 --> 41:46.462
How were they able to enter Songrim

41:46.545 --> 41:48.172
and disable the barrier
not once but twice?

41:53.093 --> 41:55.262
There was a Soul Shifter inside Songrim.

41:55.346 --> 41:58.641
Thankfully, they were able
to catch him with the Jin family's Gwigu.

41:59.600 --> 42:00.893
[Sun] Gwigu?

42:00.976 --> 42:02.853
I would like to see this Gwigu
if possible.

42:02.937 --> 42:05.231
I'm afraid I'm unable
to show you right now.

42:05.814 --> 42:08.150
Due to poor handling,
it shattered in Songrim.

42:09.235 --> 42:11.487
How could you make such a foolish mistake?

42:13.030 --> 42:14.365
My apologies, Your Majesty.

42:15.241 --> 42:17.618
As a result
of Jin Mu's recent contribution,

42:17.701 --> 42:19.411
I summoned you here

42:19.495 --> 42:22.873
to inform you I'm considering
appointing him to the next Gwanju.

42:22.957 --> 42:24.208
That's impossible.

42:24.291 --> 42:28.212
You don't consider Jang Gang
as the current Gwanju of Cheonbugwan?

42:28.295 --> 42:31.090
He's been given the robe
and the sword by the late king.

42:31.173 --> 42:32.049
Don't you remember?

42:32.633 --> 42:35.302
Also, you must consider Jang Uk, his son.

42:35.386 --> 42:36.303
But Jang Gang…

42:37.388 --> 42:38.430
has been away from his seat

42:38.514 --> 42:40.140
for decades under the pretext of training.

42:40.224 --> 42:43.269
[Go Won] Besides, his son, Jang Uk,
is unable to learn any spells.

42:43.352 --> 42:45.271
The one who's been fulfilling his duties…

42:46.522 --> 42:47.606
is the Assistant Gwanju.

42:49.441 --> 42:51.235
[Ho-gyeong] Your Majesty,
the evil technique

42:51.318 --> 42:55.447
of exchanging human souls
is a forbidden sorcery among mages.

42:55.531 --> 42:57.408
And Songrim has always been the one

42:57.950 --> 42:59.785
to track down those who commit the act.

43:00.369 --> 43:03.872
Even with this Soul Shifter,
Songrim could have found it

43:03.956 --> 43:05.332
and gotten rid of it.

43:07.126 --> 43:10.921
But just because he decided
to kill every single one of them,

43:12.131 --> 43:14.508
Jin Mu ruined everything for us.

43:14.592 --> 43:16.218
Jin Ho-gyeong, are you unhappy

43:17.052 --> 43:19.888
that Cheonbugwan is rewarded
for its contributions to the matter?

43:19.972 --> 43:22.099
Songrim caught Naksu, not Cheonbugwan!

43:22.182 --> 43:24.059
[Heo Yeom]
Why are you taking credit for it?

43:26.478 --> 43:28.314
Heo Yeom, we're not here
to argue about that.

43:30.816 --> 43:34.486
For the Gwanju position, as soon as
Jang Gang returns from his long journey,

43:34.570 --> 43:37.573
the mages of Songrim will hold a meeting
and make the decision there.

43:38.741 --> 43:41.702
Jin Mu should receive something else.

43:41.785 --> 43:44.163
[tense music playing]

43:45.205 --> 43:46.206
Jin Mu.

43:48.417 --> 43:50.210
Tell me what else you would most desire.

43:53.172 --> 43:55.007
The people have been greatly troubled.

43:55.090 --> 43:57.259
So let me burn Naksu's body
in front of Cheonbugwan.

43:57.343 --> 43:58.761
And Naksu's sword…

43:59.928 --> 44:03.182
Since Songrim has lost it,
I would like to store it in Cheonbugwan.

44:05.017 --> 44:06.101
[sighs]

44:07.102 --> 44:08.312
You may do as you please.

44:17.529 --> 44:18.864
[Dang-gu] Oh, traditionally speaking,

44:18.947 --> 44:21.700
the swords imbued with the energy
of the best mages

44:21.784 --> 44:24.536
have all but been sealed away
in the Sword Room of Jeongjingak.

44:25.162 --> 44:28.957
But, with this, they're doing
with tradition, right?

44:29.625 --> 44:31.835
So you said Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan
had Naksu's sword?

44:31.919 --> 44:34.880
Yeah. And he said he's going
to burn Naksu's body there, too.

44:34.963 --> 44:38.050
Hmm, so she will be there
to witness the burning of her body, then.

44:38.133 --> 44:40.177
Who will? Naksu?

44:41.011 --> 44:43.138
You still think
Naksu shifted her soul into someone?

44:43.222 --> 44:44.390
[laughs softly]

44:44.473 --> 44:46.809
Are you hoping to find Naksu
so she could be your master?

44:46.892 --> 44:47.893
[laughs jokingly]

44:47.976 --> 44:48.936
No, sir.

44:50.104 --> 44:51.355
Pour me some tea now.

44:54.608 --> 44:57.277
Tea. If you want more, then you pour it…

44:57.945 --> 44:58.904
lazybones.

45:01.740 --> 45:04.284
Hey, Mu-deok, pour--
Where has your servant been, anyway?

45:05.661 --> 45:07.371
I have to find her.

45:07.871 --> 45:09.456
But first, I need to get that sword.

45:11.083 --> 45:13.168
[suspenseful music playing]

45:16.547 --> 45:18.549
[Mu-deok] Seeing that the Danju
has covered his tracks, 

45:19.633 --> 45:22.219
he must think that I failed
to shift souls and died.

45:24.012 --> 45:27.224
Because I don't know who the Danju
really is, I won't be able to find him.

45:35.274 --> 45:38.277
If you search for the one
selling the Spirit Plaque at the end,

45:38.360 --> 45:39.528
you will find me.

45:40.112 --> 45:41.280
I will be waiting.

45:53.125 --> 45:54.042
[firework fires]

45:56.336 --> 45:57.671
[loud explosion]

45:57.754 --> 46:00.632
[intense music playing]

46:08.807 --> 46:12.227
CHEONBUGWAN

46:12.311 --> 46:14.021
I am here to acquire Naksu's sword, sir.

46:14.730 --> 46:16.023
Why do you want it?

46:16.106 --> 46:19.234
[Jang Uk] I heard His Majesty allowed
Cheonbugwan to keep it.

46:19.318 --> 46:22.738
But then, it is only right
to be stored in the house of Gwanju.

46:22.821 --> 46:24.072
Since the Gwanju is not here,

46:24.156 --> 46:26.492
it's only right that I,
Assistant Gwanju, keep it.

46:29.953 --> 46:31.413
Since the Gwanju has not been here,

46:31.997 --> 46:33.540
it's right that I keep it
as the son, not you.

46:33.624 --> 46:35.292
[tense stinger plays]

46:38.253 --> 46:40.756
I've heard you've been
searching everywhere for a master.

46:41.423 --> 46:43.133
I'd like to take you in myself.

46:43.759 --> 46:47.304
However, I will not defy your father
since he was my master.

46:48.347 --> 46:51.433
I simply cannot fathom any reason
as to why he…

46:52.643 --> 46:54.186
blocked your gate of energy?

46:58.857 --> 47:01.276
[Jin Mu] This sword contains
the energy of a mage.

47:01.860 --> 47:05.447
Someone as ordinary as yourself
won't be able to draw a mage's sword.

47:18.293 --> 47:19.336
[loud clack]

47:29.179 --> 47:30.973
Were you afraid
that I would unsheathe her sword?

47:31.807 --> 47:33.016
[chuckles]

47:34.059 --> 47:36.478
If I did, I'll be qualified
to become the next Gwanju,

47:36.562 --> 47:39.856
meaning that you, the Assistant Gwanju,
would be unable to rise to that seat.

47:40.732 --> 47:41.984
[amused chuckle]

47:42.693 --> 47:43.819
[chuckles]

47:44.861 --> 47:46.154
You don't have to worry, though.

47:46.697 --> 47:48.073
I cannot draw it, not yet.

48:00.002 --> 48:01.211
"Not yet?"

48:05.257 --> 48:07.759
I saw fireworks coming from Danhyanggok.

48:07.843 --> 48:09.761
Are you certain
they were fired from Danhyanggok?

48:09.845 --> 48:13.223
Yes. They came from the valley.
From Naksu's home.

48:13.307 --> 48:16.518
[suspenseful music playing]

48:20.188 --> 48:21.690
[indistinct chattering]

48:32.743 --> 48:34.870
I'm looking for the one
selling the Spirit Plaque.

48:44.838 --> 48:46.131
They've come here looking for you.

48:49.593 --> 48:50.927
[chuckles]

48:51.011 --> 48:52.679
So, someone must be here to buy it, then?

48:57.934 --> 49:00.103
They are waiting in the room at the end.

49:06.193 --> 49:07.819
How could you lose something so precious?

49:07.903 --> 49:10.280
I didn't. I'm telling you,
someone stole it.

49:10.364 --> 49:11.865
I'm certain that it was Ae-hyang.

49:14.493 --> 49:16.328
[Ae-hyang] Are you the one
who brought this?

49:18.830 --> 49:21.083
I am here to buy the Spirit Plaque
that was drawn there.

49:21.917 --> 49:23.460
Well, you have come to the right place.

49:30.717 --> 49:32.511
[Jin Mu] She has outlived her usefulness.

49:32.594 --> 49:34.304
Kill her to avoid any problems.

49:35.138 --> 49:36.932
[suspenseful music playing]

49:46.858 --> 49:47.818
You know me.

49:47.901 --> 49:50.070
Didn't I tell you to send word
if anybody brought that drawing?

49:50.821 --> 49:52.239
I did send word.

49:52.322 --> 49:54.533
She ran upstairs to meet the person
who came to buy.

49:55.409 --> 49:57.703
So it was Ae-hyang that stole the plaque.

49:57.786 --> 49:58.870
[Ae-hyang screams]

49:58.954 --> 50:01.915
- [crowd gasping, shouting]
- [loud thud]

50:03.083 --> 50:04.459
We're mages from Cheonbugwan.

50:05.043 --> 50:08.255
[male mage] We've apprehended a thief,
so please continue as you were.

50:14.636 --> 50:15.637
[Mu-deok] He killed her.

50:16.763 --> 50:18.306
He thought she was me and killed her.

50:22.978 --> 50:25.147
[ominous music playing]

50:38.869 --> 50:40.120
[muttered chattering]

50:43.123 --> 50:43.999
[Ju-wol gasps]

50:47.419 --> 50:49.004
[Mu-deok] So the Danju has cut me off.

50:57.304 --> 50:59.055
[crowd chattering indistinctly]

51:16.948 --> 51:19.659
[Seo Yul] Are you really her?

51:23.955 --> 51:25.749
- [Gil-ju] You may begin.
- [mage] Yes, my Lord.

51:31.254 --> 51:32.923
[somber music playing]

51:52.359 --> 51:55.028
[spectator 1] Cheonbugwan caught Naksu
when Songrim failed?

51:55.111 --> 51:57.572
[spectator 2] Well, yeah,
Songrim was pretty much humiliated.

51:57.656 --> 51:59.908
[spectator 1] Oh look,
it's Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan

51:59.991 --> 52:00.992
sitting over there.

52:01.076 --> 52:02.035
[spectator 2] Oh!

52:03.537 --> 52:06.164
[intense percussive music playing]

52:18.218 --> 52:19.553
[Mu-deok] So, the Danju…

52:20.303 --> 52:23.974
is really Jin Mu, the Assistant Gwanju
of the royal Cheonbugwan.

52:36.444 --> 52:37.612
I am burning.

52:39.948 --> 52:43.743
Just like how my home
and my parents burned that day.

52:43.827 --> 52:46.830
[melancholy music playing]

52:50.250 --> 52:52.043
[Jin Mu]
I promise I will give you strength.

52:52.127 --> 52:53.837
Are you willing to follow me?

53:32.167 --> 53:33.209
Young Master.

53:34.252 --> 53:36.755
As you can see,
even as I watch my body burn,

53:37.964 --> 53:39.716
there's nothing I can do to stop it.

53:41.801 --> 53:43.595
There's nothing I can do for you, either.

53:50.810 --> 53:52.145
I found your sword, finally.

53:59.736 --> 54:02.489
[Jang Uk] You could retrieve your energy
with the power of the sword, right?

54:08.995 --> 54:12.040
Hey, why are you just staring at it?
Come on, just take it out.

54:18.004 --> 54:20.048
[tense music playing]

54:30.141 --> 54:32.519
I knew that an excellent sword
would recognize its owner.

54:33.979 --> 54:36.856
[thrilling music playing]

54:42.904 --> 54:45.365
All I need to do now
is absorb the sword's energy.

54:47.867 --> 54:48.910
[sighs in relief]

54:57.002 --> 54:58.586
[echoed ringing]

55:12.017 --> 55:13.101
[grunts]

55:14.102 --> 55:15.353
[Mu-deok grunting]

55:21.776 --> 55:24.195
[Jang Uk] You're too weak
to handle the energy of your own sword.

55:25.280 --> 55:26.573
You can't even unsheathe it.

55:29.200 --> 55:30.952
You're just as powerless as me.

55:31.953 --> 55:33.246
Just a useless body.

55:38.543 --> 55:41.087
Just stop. That is enough.

55:41.796 --> 55:42.922
Leave.

55:48.636 --> 55:50.346
I highly doubt
you'll be a threat to Songrim

55:50.430 --> 55:52.474
in that useless body
and Naksu is nothing but ash.

55:53.808 --> 55:55.310
Just live your life as Mu-deok.

56:00.982 --> 56:02.150
I would rather die…

56:06.654 --> 56:07.947
than live in this body.

56:10.617 --> 56:12.160
Then go ahead and die.

56:17.665 --> 56:20.418
[melancholy music playing]

56:33.515 --> 56:34.557
[sighs]

56:38.770 --> 56:40.980
[harmonious music playing]

56:47.946 --> 56:48.988
[sighs]

57:04.462 --> 57:06.422
This is the grave of the Soul Shifters.

57:07.507 --> 57:10.009
[Jin Mu] Even the one who taught me
the Alchemy of Souls

57:10.093 --> 57:12.637
disposed of the bodies
of many Soul Shifters here.

57:23.565 --> 57:24.691
In the end…

57:26.109 --> 57:27.944
this place was meant to be my grave.

57:37.745 --> 57:40.081
[dramatic music playing]

57:42.959 --> 57:44.711
[water splashing]

57:48.715 --> 57:50.633
[soft somber music playing]

57:54.888 --> 57:55.763
[Ju-wol clears throat]

57:55.847 --> 57:58.933
[Ju-wol] Young Master, how much longer
should we remain closed?

58:00.768 --> 58:02.103
I'll be leaving soon.

58:02.770 --> 58:04.481
Is everything okay between you two?

58:04.564 --> 58:06.232
Mu-deok seemed a little out of it.

58:09.402 --> 58:11.696
[coughs]
I'm just worried.

58:12.614 --> 58:14.908
It looked like she was heading
toward Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

58:17.911 --> 58:18.828
Gyeongcheondaeho?

58:22.290 --> 58:23.791
[Mu-deok] I would rather die…

58:25.585 --> 58:26.794
than live in this body.

58:26.878 --> 58:28.338
Then go ahead and die.

58:52.111 --> 58:53.613
[muffled chiming]

59:13.258 --> 59:15.552
[epic music playing]

59:42.161 --> 59:43.121
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok!

59:44.247 --> 59:45.164
Mu-deok!

01:00:21.534 --> 01:00:22.535
[sword chimes]

01:00:49.187 --> 01:00:52.649
SEJUKWON, SONGRIM

01:01:03.201 --> 01:01:04.577
You're in Sejukwon.

01:01:05.787 --> 01:01:07.330
Master Heo Yeom's infirmary in Songrim.

01:01:08.289 --> 01:01:09.999
It's been a while
since I was allowed in here

01:01:10.083 --> 01:01:11.417
but thanks to you,
they let me in.

01:01:14.128 --> 01:01:17.507
Your eyes probably sting.
I've put in some eye drops.

01:01:18.216 --> 01:01:20.134
He said the blue marks
of Soul Shifting in your eyes

01:01:20.218 --> 01:01:21.344
are like bruises.

01:01:21.427 --> 01:01:23.971
So if you use these special eye drops,
they should go away quickly.

01:01:24.597 --> 01:01:25.682
Put them in regularly.

01:01:33.564 --> 01:01:34.982
I unsheathed my sword.

01:01:36.943 --> 01:01:38.069
I definitely unsheathed it.

01:01:38.152 --> 01:01:39.654
I know. I saw.

01:01:40.405 --> 01:01:42.198
[Jang Uk]
But you still don't have any energy.

01:01:42.281 --> 01:01:44.534
You probably could earlier
thanks to Gyeongcheondaeho's energy.

01:01:45.910 --> 01:01:47.954
I can regain my energy inside that lake.

01:01:49.580 --> 01:01:50.873
I need to go back in there.

01:01:50.957 --> 01:01:54.419
What? Will you live in the lake forever,
like a fish?

01:02:00.049 --> 01:02:02.301
[Mu-deok] When I was in the lake,
I felt a huge surge of energy.

01:02:03.261 --> 01:02:04.721
And then I regained my energy.

01:02:05.304 --> 01:02:06.556
That's right.

01:02:07.557 --> 01:02:10.017
Someone whose energy's
as powerful as Lake Gyeongcheondaeho's

01:02:10.601 --> 01:02:13.438
just has to force their energy into me
so I can recover mine.

01:02:13.521 --> 01:02:16.357
But who?
Will you search for a master, too?

01:02:17.024 --> 01:02:20.194
Do you think there's a master out there
as powerful as Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

01:02:20.278 --> 01:02:21.612
Even if there was one,

01:02:21.696 --> 01:02:23.406
who would want to help
an assassin like you?

01:02:24.407 --> 01:02:26.075
You're Naksu who's become a Soul Shifter.

01:02:29.829 --> 01:02:33.166
What? Uk is here?
Why would he come to Sejukwon?

01:02:33.249 --> 01:02:36.085
[doctor] He said his servant was injured
and needed to be treated.

01:02:36.169 --> 01:02:37.670
He wouldn't take no for an answer.

01:02:37.754 --> 01:02:38.880
Who?

01:02:40.298 --> 01:02:41.716
All right, Mu-deok, was it?

01:02:41.799 --> 01:02:43.217
How bad were her injuries

01:02:43.885 --> 01:02:46.721
that Uk would personally
bring her back to Sejukwon?

01:02:50.099 --> 01:02:52.185
[pensive music playing]

01:03:02.862 --> 01:03:05.072
I've only heard of Sejukwon,
but to be there…

01:03:05.823 --> 01:03:07.450
It truthfully is an incredible infirmary.

01:03:08.826 --> 01:03:10.453
They have every medicinal herb.

01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:12.288
And poisons, too.

01:03:18.252 --> 01:03:20.046
These are Sejukwon eye drops,

01:03:20.129 --> 01:03:22.006
so the marks in your eyes
should disappear.

01:03:22.089 --> 01:03:23.883
You should just lie low
and live as Mu-deok.

01:03:24.509 --> 01:03:26.010
This is all I can do
to help you, all right?

01:03:26.093 --> 01:03:27.386
No.

01:03:28.554 --> 01:03:30.014
I want you to be my Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

01:03:30.097 --> 01:03:31.098
so I can give you my energy.

01:03:34.519 --> 01:03:37.188
You said you risked your life for me
many times already.

01:03:38.439 --> 01:03:40.149
Risk it again just one more time for me.

01:03:46.697 --> 01:03:47.907
It'll be quite painful.

01:03:52.537 --> 01:03:53.830
[cup shatters]

01:03:55.331 --> 01:03:56.666
What did you put in here?

01:03:59.001 --> 01:04:01.003
One of the most poisonous herbs
from Sejukwon.

01:04:01.087 --> 01:04:03.798
[sinister music playing]

01:04:06.092 --> 01:04:07.301
[cup shatters]

01:04:07.885 --> 01:04:09.595
I bet my everything
that you'll survive this.

01:04:11.681 --> 01:04:14.642
Yes, that's right.
I dearly hope you will survive.

01:04:16.435 --> 01:04:17.353
[heaving]

01:04:24.610 --> 01:04:25.695
[coughs]

01:04:31.117 --> 01:04:32.410
If you do survive this…

01:04:35.746 --> 01:04:37.707
I'll agree to be your master, okay?

01:04:47.633 --> 01:04:49.176
[Jin] Uk! Uk!

01:04:50.219 --> 01:04:51.762
[Jin] Uk, what's wrong? Uk!

01:04:52.263 --> 01:04:54.724
- Uk!
- [Heo Yeom] What is wrong with Uk?

01:04:55.349 --> 01:04:56.475
He ingested poison.

01:04:58.269 --> 01:04:59.687
- Poison?
- [Heo Yeom] What poison?

01:04:59.770 --> 01:05:01.814
A poison that will cause
the Young Master's heart

01:05:01.898 --> 01:05:03.316
to stop in approximately six hours.

01:05:03.399 --> 01:05:04.567
I asked you what kind of poison?

01:05:05.151 --> 01:05:07.069
You won't have enough time
to find out what poison it is

01:05:07.153 --> 01:05:08.905
and concoct an antidote to give him.

01:05:08.988 --> 01:05:11.532
[Mu-deok] There's only one way
to save him before it's too late.

01:05:11.616 --> 01:05:12.950
Open his gate of energy

01:05:13.034 --> 01:05:16.621
and use your energies
to remove the poison from his body.

01:05:16.704 --> 01:05:17.914
What?

01:05:19.415 --> 01:05:20.708
Open his blocked gate of energy.

01:05:21.709 --> 01:05:23.127
Or he'll die because of you.

01:05:27.381 --> 01:05:28.758
[Dang-gu] Yul, Yul, Yul, Yul, Yul.

01:05:29.508 --> 01:05:31.260
[splutters]
They say that Uk was poisoned.

01:05:32.261 --> 01:05:34.221
- He's going to die.
- What?

01:05:34.305 --> 01:05:36.265
They say that Mu-deok
was the one who poisoned him.

01:05:36.349 --> 01:05:38.893
But she refuses to say
what kind of poison she used on him.

01:05:38.976 --> 01:05:41.854
So right now my uncle is torturing her.

01:05:41.938 --> 01:05:43.564
[Dang-gu whimpering]

01:05:47.276 --> 01:05:48.861
Tell me the name of the poison.

01:05:53.199 --> 01:05:54.951
Continue until she breaks.

01:05:55.034 --> 01:05:58.079
- But she could die, my lord.
- Uk will die if she doesn't talk.

01:05:58.162 --> 01:06:00.748
We must find out what poison it was
within the next two hours

01:06:00.831 --> 01:06:01.832
or he'll die.

01:06:02.750 --> 01:06:03.793
[coughs]

01:06:07.004 --> 01:06:09.340
- [groaning]
- [maid Kim] Young Master.

01:06:10.174 --> 01:06:11.300
Young Master!

01:06:13.386 --> 01:06:14.595
Please open his gate of energy.

01:06:15.805 --> 01:06:17.682
There's no other way
you can save his life.

01:06:19.058 --> 01:06:20.059
[maid Kim sobs]

01:06:20.142 --> 01:06:21.560
We're running out of time!

01:06:22.186 --> 01:06:23.312
Young Master!

01:06:24.313 --> 01:06:26.399
You have to save
the Young Master's life, please!

01:06:31.946 --> 01:06:33.990
[dramatic music playing]

01:06:41.205 --> 01:06:42.581
- [doctor] My Lord.
- [Jin] How is Uk?

01:06:42.665 --> 01:06:44.291
Tell me, has something happened to him?

01:06:44.375 --> 01:06:46.293
Master Heo Yeom
was able to remove the poison.

01:06:47.003 --> 01:06:48.504
[doctor] The Young Master will survive.

01:06:49.005 --> 01:06:50.715
Was he able to find the antidote for that?

01:06:50.798 --> 01:06:51.674
[doctor] No, my Lord.

01:06:52.341 --> 01:06:55.428
He had to open it. He opened
the Young Master's gate of energy.

01:06:59.932 --> 01:07:01.350
[harmonious music playing]

01:07:01.434 --> 01:07:02.518
[chuckles]

01:07:19.535 --> 01:07:20.911
[gasping]

01:07:20.995 --> 01:07:23.664
Young Master, how are you feeling?

01:07:36.427 --> 01:07:37.845
Am I alive or did I die?

01:07:39.346 --> 01:07:40.806
You barely survived.

01:07:40.890 --> 01:07:42.475
Master Heo saved you.

01:07:43.559 --> 01:07:45.811
But to do so,
he had to open your gate of energy.

01:07:48.230 --> 01:07:49.899
He really opened my gate of energy?

01:07:49.982 --> 01:07:51.442
Mu-deok, that lunatic,

01:07:52.151 --> 01:07:55.154
refused to tell anyone the kind of poison
she gave you, so Master Heo,

01:07:55.237 --> 01:07:59.033
he had no choice but to open
your gate of energy to remove the poison.

01:08:03.120 --> 01:08:05.164
I bet my everything
that you'll survive this.

01:08:05.998 --> 01:08:09.168
Yes, that's right.
I dearly hope you will survive.

01:08:12.671 --> 01:08:13.589
Where is Mu-deok?

01:08:22.139 --> 01:08:23.599
[coughing]

01:08:25.059 --> 01:08:27.019
[somber music playing]

01:08:32.608 --> 01:08:33.734
Mu-deok?

01:08:40.574 --> 01:08:41.659
Mu-deok, hey!

01:08:52.211 --> 01:08:53.170
Mu-deok.

01:08:56.674 --> 01:08:57.716
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

01:09:02.346 --> 01:09:03.430
Mu-deok.

01:09:14.191 --> 01:09:15.192
[sighs in relief]

01:09:18.028 --> 01:09:19.738
You could have almost killed
the both of us.

01:09:20.614 --> 01:09:21.740
You really are…

01:09:23.075 --> 01:09:24.410
You really are crazy.

01:09:27.580 --> 01:09:29.081
So you live.

01:09:30.833 --> 01:09:32.084
My pupil.

01:09:38.507 --> 01:09:39.508
Yeah.

01:09:41.677 --> 01:09:43.345
I came back from the dead, thanks to you.

01:09:50.102 --> 01:09:51.770
My crazy master.

01:09:55.357 --> 01:09:56.317
[laughs softly]

01:10:05.951 --> 01:10:08.370
["Aching" by Kassy playing]

01:11:02.716 --> 01:11:06.845
[Jin] Uk has managed to finally open
his gate of energy after all.

01:11:06.929 --> 01:11:09.306
[Jang Uk] Your pupil has come back alive,
as he promised,

01:11:09.390 --> 01:11:10.724
so you're my master from now on.

01:11:10.808 --> 01:11:12.810
[Mu-deok] In order to become the best mage
you can possibly be,

01:11:12.893 --> 01:11:15.062
there are several abilities
you must master.

01:11:15.145 --> 01:11:16.855
You are far worse
than I ever expected you to be.

01:11:16.939 --> 01:11:19.566
We were watching Yul just now.
Mu-deok asked if we could see him.

01:11:19.650 --> 01:11:20.818
[Seo Yul] That girl Mu-deok,

01:11:20.901 --> 01:11:23.612
someone who is not as they seem
is hiding something.

01:11:23.696 --> 01:11:25.447
I'm in love with you!

01:11:25.531 --> 01:11:27.741
[maid Kim] Young Master!
It's the Crown Prince.

01:11:27.825 --> 01:11:29.535
He's come from the Royal Palace
to see you.

01:11:29.618 --> 01:11:31.829
There's another sword here
which you cannot unsheathe.

01:11:31.912 --> 01:11:34.248
It'll not bode well for you
to lose the sword as well.

01:11:34.331 --> 01:11:36.667
Since you refuse,
I have no other choice.
